tatement, returning all results in a single reply. This\nmethod cannot be used to return a result set larger than 10 MiB;\nif the query yields more data than that, the query fails with\na <code>FAILED_PRECONDITION<\/code> error.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/executesqlrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\ExecuteSqlRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"ExecuteStreamingSql","type":"instance","name":"ExecuteStreamingSql","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L174","description":"<p>Like [ExecuteSql][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.ExecuteSql], except returns the result\nset as a stream. Unlike [ExecuteSql][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.ExecuteSql], there\nis no limit on the size of the returned result set. However, no\nindividual row in the result set can exceed 100 MiB, and no\ncolumn value can exceed 10 MiB.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/executesqlrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\ExecuteSqlRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\ServerStreamingCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"ExecuteBatchDml","type":"instance","name":"ExecuteBatchDml","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L199","description":"<p>Executes a batch of SQL DML statements. This method allows many statements\nto be run with lower latency than submitting them sequentially with\n[ExecuteSql][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.ExecuteSql].<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/executebatchdmlrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\ExecuteBatchDmlRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"Read","type":"instance","name":"Read","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L226","description":"<p>Reads rows from the database using key lookups and scans, as a\nsimple key\/value style alternative to\n[ExecuteSql][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.ExecuteSql].  This method cannot be used to\nreturn a result set larger than 10 MiB; if the read matches more\ndata than that, the read fails with a <code>FAILED_PRECONDITION<\/code>\nerror.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/readrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\ReadRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"StreamingRead","type":"instance","name":"StreamingRead","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L245","description":"<p>Like [Read][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.Read], except returns the result set as a\nstream. Unlike [Read][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.Read], there is no limit on the\nsize of the returned result set. However, no individual row in\nthe result set can exceed 100 MiB, and no column value can exceed\n10 MiB.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/readrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\ReadRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\ServerStreamingCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"BeginTransaction","type":"instance","name":"BeginTransaction","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L263","description":"<p>Begins a new transaction. This step can often be skipped:\n[Read][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.Read], [ExecuteSql][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.ExecuteSql] and\n[Commit][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.Commit] can begin a new transaction as a\nside-effect.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/begintransactionrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\BeginTransactionRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"Commit","type":"instance","name":"Commit","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L291","description":"<p>Commits a transaction. The request includes the mutations to be\napplied to rows in the database.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/commitrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\CommitRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"Rollback","type":"instance","name":"Rollback","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L313","description":"<p>Rolls back a transaction, releasing any locks it holds. It is a good\nidea to call this for any transaction that includes one or more\n[Read][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.Read] or [ExecuteSql][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.ExecuteSql] requests and\nultimately decides not to commit.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/rollbackrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\RollbackRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"PartitionQuery","type":"instance","name":"PartitionQuery","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L338","description":"<p>Creates a set of partition tokens that can be used to execute a query\noperation in parallel.  Each of the returned partition tokens can be used\nby [ExecuteStreamingSql][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.ExecuteStreamingSql] to specify a subset\nof the query result to read.  The same session and read-only transaction\nmust be used by the PartitionQueryRequest used to create the\npartition tokens and the ExecuteSqlRequests that use the partition tokens.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/partitionqueryrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\PartitionQueryRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]},{"id":"PartitionRead","type":"instance","name":"PartitionRead","source":"Spanner\/src\/V1\/SpannerGrpcClient.php#L365","description":"<p>Creates a set of partition tokens that can be used to execute a read\noperation in parallel.  Each of the returned partition tokens can be used\nby [StreamingRead][google.spanner.v1.Spanner.StreamingRead] to specify a subset of the read\nresult to read.  The same session and read-only transaction must be used by\nthe PartitionReadRequest used to create the partition tokens and the\nReadRequests that use the partition tokens.  There are no ordering\nguarantees on rows returned among the returned partition tokens, or even\nwithin each individual StreamingRead call issued with a partition_token.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"argument","description":"<p>input argument<\/p>","types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-spanner\/master\/spanner\/v1\/partitionreadrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Spanner\\V1\\PartitionReadRequest<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"metadata","description":"<p>metadata<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"options","description":"<p>call options<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["\\Grpc\\UnaryCall"],"description":""}]}]}